# Input

```css
.twelve-values{font-family:family-a,family-b,family-c,family-d,family-e,family-f,
family-g,family-h,family-i,family-j,family-k,family-l;}
.thirteen-values{font-family:family-a,family-b,family-c,family-d,family-e,family-f,
family-g,family-h,family-i,family-j,family-k,family-l,family-m;}

.one-character-value{font-family:family-a,family-b,family-c,family-d,family-e,family-f,
family-g,family-h,family-i,family-j,family-k,family-l,x;}
.multibyte-character-value{font-family:family-a,family-b,family-c,family-d,family-e,family-f,
family-g,family-h,family-i,family-j,family-k,family-l,é;}

.below-width{font-family:font-a,font-b,font-c,font-d,font-e,font-f,
font-g,font-h,font-i,font-j,font-k,font-l,font-mm;}
.at-width{font-family:font-a,font-b,font-c,font-d,font-e,font-f,
font-g,font-h,font-i,font-j,font-k,font-l,font-mmm;}
.below-width-with-trivia{font-family:  font-a,  font-b,  font-c,  font-d,  font-e,  font-f,
  font-g,  font-h,  font-i,  font-j,  font-k,  font-l, /* final family */ font-mm   ;}

.slash-separated{value:value-aa value-bb value-cc value-dd value-ee value-ff /
value-gg value-hh value-ii value-jj value-kk value-ll value-mm;}
.space-separated{value:value-aa value-bb value-cc value-dd value-ee value-ff
value-gg value-hh value-ii value-jj value-kk value-ll value-mm;}

```


# Formatted

```css
.twelve-values {
	font-family:
		family-a, family-b, family-c, family-d, family-e, family-f, family-g,
		family-h, family-i, family-j, family-k, family-l;
}
.thirteen-values {
	font-family:
		family-a, family-b, family-c, family-d, family-e, family-f,
		family-g, family-h, family-i, family-j, family-k, family-l, family-m;
}

.one-character-value {
	font-family:
		family-a, family-b, family-c, family-d, family-e, family-f, family-g,
		family-h, family-i, family-j, family-k, family-l, x;
}
.multibyte-character-value {
	font-family:
		family-a, family-b, family-c, family-d, family-e, family-f,
		family-g, family-h, family-i, family-j, family-k, family-l, é;
}

.below-width {
	font-family:
		font-a, font-b, font-c, font-d, font-e, font-f, font-g, font-h, font-i,
		font-j, font-k, font-l, font-mm;
}
.at-width {
	font-family:
		font-a, font-b, font-c, font-d, font-e, font-f,
		font-g, font-h, font-i, font-j, font-k, font-l, font-mmm;
}
.below-width-with-trivia {
	font-family:
		font-a, font-b, font-c, font-d, font-e, font-f, font-g, font-h, font-i,
		font-j, font-k, font-l, /* final family */ font-mm;
}

.slash-separated {
	value:
		value-aa value-bb value-cc value-dd value-ee value-ff /
		value-gg value-hh value-ii value-jj value-kk value-ll value-mm;
}
.space-separated {
	value: value-aa value-bb value-cc value-dd value-ee value-ff value-gg value-hh
		value-ii value-jj value-kk value-ll value-mm;
}

```
